# 📊 Activity Log Rules

- Every Firestore mutation (create/update/delete) must call `logActivity()`.
- Each log entry must include:
  - `action` (string)
  - `collection` (string)
  - `documentId` (string)
  - `performedBy` (user.uid)
  - `timestamp` (serverTimestamp)
  - `details` (string, optional)
- No updates/deletes to existing log entries — immutable.
- Logs should be accessible under `/dashboard/activity`.
